cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper."
title: "Diffusion models for uncertainty quantification in analytic continuation"
abstract: >-
  A conditional diffusion-model framework for the numerical analytic continuation
  of imaginary-time correlation functions to real-frequency spectra, which learns
  the full conditional distribution of admissible spectra and quantifies the
  intrinsic uncertainty of the inversion.
